        "description": "Family history of HLRCC-associated manifestations",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of pathogenic FH gene mutation plus either multiple cutaneous leiomyomas or early-onset uterine leiomyomas or renal cell carcinoma",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is critical for confirmation; histopathology supports diagnosis."
